      "title": "PRISM test settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## RUNA PRISM / Singularity test\nModel: `PRISM_DMAD_PDMD_int8.safetensors` from https://huggingface.co/OliviaRossi/Minimax-h3_Singularity-x-10Eros-Max_PRISM\n\nEuler sampler, BetaSamplingScheduler alpha 0.5 / beta 0.7, 8 steps, H3 video shift 12 / audio shift 3.\nTurbo LoRA OFF. 8 seconds, 1 MP, 16:9. Set your images and enter your own prompt before running.\nThis is an experimental adaptation and requires GPU validation."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## RUNA PRISM / Singularity test\nModel: `PRISM_DMAD_PDMD_int8.safetensors` from https://huggingface.co/OliviaRossi/Minimax-h3_Singularity-x-10Eros-Max_PRISM\n\nEuler sampler, BetaSamplingScheduler alpha 0.5 / beta 0.7, 8 steps, H3 video shift 12 / audio shift 3.\nTurbo LoRA OFF. 8 seconds, 1 MP, 16:9. Set your images and enter your own prompt before running.\nThis is an experimental adaptation and requires GPU validation."
      },
